# Copy to `.env` and fill in.
# When unset, the app calls `/api/*` which the Vite dev server proxies
# to `http://localhost:3000` (see vite.config.ts).
VITE_API_URL=

# Socket.IO origin. When unset in dev, the client connects same-origin and
# Vite proxies `/socket.io` to the backend. In production set this to your
# API origin (e.g. https://api.example.com). If VITE_API_URL is a full
# origin it is reused automatically.
VITE_SOCKET_URL=
